Modifications and additions in this fork (Copyright (c) 2026 GeekTCLin)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
- Local web agent: Bun HTTP server (`src/web/`) plus a React/Vite SPA (`web/`)
  with SSE streaming, tool timeline, tool approvals, ask-user questions,
  cancel, multi-conversation history, lifecycle notices, and a Chinese UI.
- China A-share / domestic-market data:
  * `get_index_snapshot` / `get_index_snapshots` / `get_index_prices`
    (`src/tools/finance/domestic-index*.ts`)
  * `domestic_search` (`flash` / `sentiment` / `news` / `announcements`)
    (`src/tools/search/domestic-search*.ts`)
- Keyless web search providers (Bing CN, Baidu) with optional Exa / Tavily /
  LangSearch fallbacks (`src/tools/search/bing.ts`, `baidu.ts`).
- Conditional gating of US financial-data tools on FINANCIAL_DATASETS_API_KEY.
- Semantic memory embeddings: placeholder-aware provider selection, a generic
  OpenAI-compatible provider, failure cooldown, and graceful keyword-only
  degradation (`src/memory/embeddings.ts`).
- Additional LLM provider: OpenCode Go (`src/providers.ts`, `src/model/llm.ts`).

